task (completed) {
  update news sources {source}

  Implemented:
  news_fetch.php
  - Added the `wsj` source with all six Dow Jones RSS feeds from {source}:
    Markets, US Business, Tech, World News, US News, and Social Economy.
    Each feed is its own section, and a `per_feed_limit` keeps a balanced
    10-story sample from every section (60 stories by default).
  - Kept `full_article` off for WSJ: its RSS feeds carry only a short deck and
    the article pages return HTTP 401 (paywall/bot block), so a forced
    full-article fetch would replace usable text with nothing. The feed deck
    is used as the detail body instead.
  app/chat_server.py
  - Added wsj to NEWS_SOURCES (tab completion and source selection), the
    /news help text, and the /news command docstring.
  - Verified with `php news_fetch.php --json --source wsj --limit 3`, which
    streamed items with titles, dates, images, and paragraphs.
}

